{"4983570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Death Paradise", "steam_appid": 4983570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4998810], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paradise Won’t Survive the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outbreak began only hours ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miami Beach still shines beneath the tropical sun, but the streets are empty, communications are dead, and something is hunting between the abandoned hotels, beaches, and neon-lit alleys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Death Paradise, you must survive the first 24 hours of a zombie catastrophe, assemble a team, restore the island’s emergency systems, and transmit an SOS signal before paradise falls completely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Have 24 Hours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infection is spreading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight gives you time to search the island, recover supplies, rescue stranded survivors, and prepare vital infrastructure. But as evening approaches, the infected become more numerous and every objective becomes harder to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the generator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore power to the antennas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the emergency signal online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then keep everything running long enough for rescue to find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/4ebdc00b8d662d2cdbd0e40c222326ff.poster.avif?t=1788039387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/4ebdc00b8d662d2cdbd0e40c222326ff.webm?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/4ebdc00b8d662d2cdbd0e40c222326ff.mp4?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone escaped the first wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the campaign, you will find and rescue three AI-controlled survivors. Each rescued teammate joins your squad and fights beside you in future missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the appearance and beach outfits of your companions, equip yourself for the next mission, and keep your team alive as the situation becomes increasingly desperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every survivor you save gives you another chance to make it through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/3b2c00d66d7159263f86af4380c4aa9c.poster.avif?t=1788039387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/3b2c00d66d7159263f86af4380c4aa9c.webm?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/3b2c00d66d7159263f86af4380c4aa9c.mp4?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with firearms, bows, brutal melee weapons, and improvised equipment found throughout the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through the infected with a katana, keep enemies at a distance with military rifles, or charge into danger using a trash-can lid as a makeshift shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right weapon for the situation—or use whatever is still in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/9284deb00846de942fab7924847881d1.poster.avif?t=1788039387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/9284deb00846de942fab7924847881d1.webm?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/9284deb00846de942fab7924847881d1.mp4?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They Don’t All Move Like Zombies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some infected stumble toward you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others sprint, leap, spit acid, dodge gunfire, or explode when they get too close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy type changes the rhythm of combat, forcing you to move, react, and adapt before your team is overwhelmed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Is More Than Killing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is collapsing, and bullets alone will not save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore generators, activate communication antennas, recover emergency equipment, rescue survivors, defend strategic locations, and hold back waves of infected while critical systems come online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your final objective is simple:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the SOS signal active and reach the evacuation point before the island goes dark.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/49653b0a26d563f362700b31b261251d.poster.avif?t=1788039387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/49653b0a26d563f362700b31b261251d.webm?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/49653b0a26d563f362700b31b261251d.mp4?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Longest Day in Paradise</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the signal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the first 24 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape before paradise becomes a graveyard.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paradise Won’t Survive the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outbreak began only hours ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miami Beach still shines beneath the tropical sun, but the streets are empty, communications are dead, and something is hunting between the abandoned hotels, beaches, and neon-lit alleys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Death Paradise, you must survive the first 24 hours of a zombie catastrophe, assemble a team, restore the island’s emergency systems, and transmit an SOS signal before paradise falls completely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Have 24 Hours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infection is spreading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight gives you time to search the island, recover supplies, rescue stranded survivors, and prepare vital infrastructure. But as evening approaches, the infected become more numerous and every objective becomes harder to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the generator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore power to the antennas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the emergency signal online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then keep everything running long enough for rescue to find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/4ebdc00b8d662d2cdbd0e40c222326ff.poster.avif?t=1788039387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https