=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right weapon for the situation—or use whatever is still in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/9284deb00846de942fab7924847881d1.poster.avif?t=1788039387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/9284deb00846de942fab7924847881d1.webm?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/9284deb00846de942fab7924847881d1.mp4?t=1788039387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They Don’t All Move Like Zombies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some infected stumble toward you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others sprint, leap, spit acid, dodge gunfire, or explode when they get too close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy type changes the rhythm of combat, forcing you to move, react, and adapt before your team is overwhelmed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Is More Than Killing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is collapsing, and bullets alone will not save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore generators, activate communication antennas, recover emergency equipment, rescue survivors, defend strategic locations, and hold back waves of infected while critical systems come online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your final objective is simple:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the SOS signal active and reach the evacuation point before the island goes dark.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983570/extras/49653b0a26d563f362700b31b261251d.poster.avif?t=17